SMS Gateway is a small PHP web application for sending SMS messages through a
Huawei HiLink LTE modem or similar USB dongle that exposes a local XML HTTP API.
It provides JSON HTTP endpoints for checking modem health, scanning available
mobile networks, validating API tokens, and sending SMS messages.

The project also includes FreeBSD-specific support for configuring a Huawei LTE
dongle at boot, keeping the primary network default route intact by default, and
publishing the gateway through Apache.
